     "solution": "Eval harness: keep. The entry point: runs a suite, builds a report, compares reports\nCase: keep. A prompt, a reference answer or tests; the graders read what they need from it\nGrader (exact, rubric, code): keep. Scores one dimension; each decides whether it applies to a case\nScore: keep. A value or Unknown, with a note; it knows whether it is known\nReport: keep. The scores by case, and the mean per dimension\nDimension stats: keep. A mean with its known and Unknown counts; it prints itself\nRegression: keep. A dimension that fell, from what to what; it prints itself\nSuite: drop. A list of cases; nothing to add\nBaseline: drop. A dict of dimension to mean; the report makes it, the harness reads it\nSystem under test, judge model: drop. External: anything callable, not our classes\nDimension: drop. A string; the graders name it",
